    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "counselors and budgets dont change the fact that the money is gone. it feels so permanent. like no matter what i do, it just gets worse. it's not just a \"small step\" problem, it's a \"there is no future\" problem. everything is just a cycle of losing. i'm just so tired of fighting a battle that's already lost.",
